regress/gate_asan_sweep.sh-421-#  SM_COVERED lesson from gate_offline.sh is that a manifest nothing cross-checks verifies
regress/gate_asan_sweep.sh-422-#  the LEDGER, not the WORK. Deleting the line is a one-line fix and the message says so.
